<div class="text-[0.75rem] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#8B3A3A] mb-6">Incorrect Usage (Zero Tolerance)</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
<!-- Colorizing Ampersand -->
