<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-normal text-[#1C1C1E] mb-2">11. Motion</h2>
<p class="font-sans text-[1rem] text-[#55555A] max-w-3xl mb-12 leading-relaxed">Strictly <code>4px</code> border radiuses and <code>0.5px</code> hairlines. All movement runs on <strong>Acre&amp;Key Motion Physics</strong>: a suite of cinematic, gravity-weighted CSS animations that avoid cheap "bouncy" effects in favor of slow, deliberate reveals.</p>
<div>
<!-- Pillar 1: Cinematic Reveal -->
<div class="demo-reveal">
<div>1. Cinematic Reveal</div>
<div>
